[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 0.94,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Welcome back to Trail Sessions.",
    "char_start": 17,
    "char_end": 48,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 0.94,
    "end": 4.63,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Today, we're talking about trail building, and with me is Rafael Vasconcelos, a trail builder from the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 49,
    "char_end": 170,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 4.63,
    "end": 6.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Rafael Vasconcelos, thank you for being here.",
    "char_start": 171,
    "char_end": 216,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 6.0,
    "end": 7.23,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Thank you, Beatriz.",
    "char_start": 237,
    "char_end": 256,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 7.23,
    "end": 12.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "My pleasure – building trails is something I've been thinking about a lot.",
    "char_start": 257,
    "char_end": 331,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.0,
    "end": 14.27,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "This episode is sponsored by Strava.",
    "char_start": 349,
    "char_end": 385,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.27,
    "end": 16.23,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Strava is the home of athletes.",
    "char_start": 386,
    "char_end": 417,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 16.23,
    "end": 18.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Start at strava.com/podcast.",
    "char_start": 418,
    "char_end": 446,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.0,
    "end": 21.04,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Tell me about how you made that decision.",
    "char_start": 447,
    "char_end": 488,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.04,
    "end": 24.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 489,
    "char_end": 529,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s05"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.0,
    "end": 26.38,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Honestly, drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 550,
    "char_end": 633,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.38,
    "end": 27.99,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 634,
    "char_end": 690,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 27.99,
    "end": 30.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I've already seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 691,
    "char_end": 761,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 30.0,
    "end": 32.27,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 779,
    "char_end": 813,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 32.27,
    "end": 36.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
    "char_start": 814,
    "char_end": 870,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.0,
    "end": 39.56,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Yes, look – the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too steep a slope.",
    "char_start": 891,
    "char_end": 987,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 39.56,
    "end": 42.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 988,
    "char_end": 1054,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.0,
    "end": 44.25,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "char_start": 1072,
    "char_end": 1105,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.25,
    "end": 48.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1106,
    "char_end": 1161,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.0,
    "end": 48.28,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "char_start": 1182,
    "char_end": 1192,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.28,
    "end": 50.42,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Discussions about land management must take place before the first excavation.",
    "char_start": 1193,
    "char_end": 1271,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 50.42,
    "end": 51.85,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox products.",
    "char_start": 1272,
    "char_end": 1324,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 51.85,
    "end": 54.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "The context is important because it tells you what commitments you are making.",
    "char_start": 1325,
    "char_end": 1403,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 54.0,
    "end": 60.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Tell me more about it.",
    "char_start": 1421,
    "char_end": 1443,
    "unit_id": "t0008.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0008.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 60.0,
    "end": 66.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the commitment becomes evident. If you ignore that, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 1464,
    "char_end": 1643,
    "unit_id": "t0009.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0009.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.0,
    "end": 68.29,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 1661,
    "char_end": 1695,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 68.29,
    "end": 72.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1696,
    "char_end": 1751,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.0,
    "end": 72.29,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "char_start": 1772,
    "char_end": 1782,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.29,
    "end": 74.11,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "The cuts in the benching areas on the slopes are not optional.",
    "char_start": 1783,
    "char_end": 1845,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 74.11,
    "end": 75.98,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "The shortcut of the first day is the downfall of the third year.",
    "char_start": 1846,
    "char_end": 1910,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 75.98,
    "end": 78.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone ignores.",
    "char_start": 1911,
    "char_end": 1980,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 78.0,
    "end": 80.13,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "That's a useful perspective.",
    "char_start": 1998,
    "char_end": 2026,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 80.13,
    "end": 84.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the most important version of the question?",
    "char_start": 2027,
    "char_end": 2078,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 84.0,
    "end": 86.34,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Yes, look – the structure of the team is more important than people realize.",
    "char_start": 2099,
    "char_end": 2175,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 86.34,
    "end": 87.85,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 2176,
    "char_end": 2225,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 87.85,
    "end": 90.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I've already seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2226,
    "char_end": 2296,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 90.0,
    "end": 91.94,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the nature of the failure?",
    "char_start": 2314,
    "char_end": 2348,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 91.94,
    "end": 96.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the structural aspect that most listeners are unable to access?",
    "char_start": 2349,
    "char_end": 2420,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 96.0,
    "end": 97.59,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 2441,
    "char_end": 2493,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 97.59,
    "end": 99.86,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I've changed my mind about machine-made trails compared to hand-made ones.",
    "char_start": 2494,
    "char_end": 2568,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 99.86,
    "end": 102.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I've already seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2569,
    "char_end": 2639,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 102.0,
    "end": 108.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Tell me more about it.",
    "char_start": 2657,
    "char_end": 2679,
    "unit_id": "t0016.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0016.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 108.0,
    "end": 114.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "And when teams adopt the Cascadia Alliance framework, that commitment becomes evident. If you ignore it, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 2700,
    "char_end": 2874,
    "unit_id": "t0017.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0017.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 114.0,
    "end": 120.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "We'll be right back after a short commercial break.",
    "char_start": 2892,
    "char_end": 2943,
    "unit_id": "t0018.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0018.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 120.0,
    "end": 121.47,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Today's episode is brought to you by Stripe.",
    "char_start": 2956,
    "char_end": 3000,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 121.47,
    "end": 124.6,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Stripe makes payments simple, whether you're running a marketplace or a subscription business.",
    "char_start": 3001,
    "char_end": 3095,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.6,
    "end": 126.0,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Visit stripe.com/podcast for a free trial.",
    "char_start": 3096,
    "char_end": 3138,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 126.0,
    "end": 127.4,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Welcome back to the program.",
    "char_start": 3156,
    "char_end": 3184,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 127.4,
    "end": 129.25,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 3185,
    "char_end": 3222,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 129.25,
    "end": 132.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 3223,
    "char_end": 3278,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.0,
    "end": 132.51,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "That's how I see it.",
    "char_start": 3299,
    "char_end": 3319,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.51,
    "end": 134.37,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 3320,
    "char_end": 3393,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 134.37,
    "end": 135.73,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano products.",
    "char_start": 3394,
    "char_end": 3447,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 135.73,
    "end": 138.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 3448,
    "char_end": 3537,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 138.0,
    "end": 140.76,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 3555,
    "char_end": 3589,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 140.76,
    "end": 144.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 3590,
    "char_end": 3630,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 144.0,
    "end": 147.59,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Yes, listen – the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too steep a slope.",
    "char_start": 3651,
    "char_end": 3749,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 147.59,
    "end": 150.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 3750,
    "char_end": 3816,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 150.0,
    "end": 151.76,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "It challenges my conventional wisdom.",
    "char_start": 3834,
    "char_end": 3871,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 151.76,
    "end": 156.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What did you used to believe about this, and how has your perspective changed since then?",
    "char_start": 3872,
    "char_end": 3961,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.0,
    "end": 157.26,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 3982,
    "char_end": 4034,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 157.26,
    "end": 159.12,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Discussions about land management need to happen before the first excavation.",
    "char_start": 4035,
    "char_end": 4112,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 159.12,
    "end": 160.31,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 4113,
    "char_end": 4162,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 160.31,
    "end": 162.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I've already seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4163,
    "char_end": 4233,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 162.0,
    "end": 168.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "That makes sense.",
    "char_start": 4251,
    "char_end": 4268,
    "unit_id": "t0026.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0026.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 168.0,
    "end": 171.61,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Outside of the tools provided by the Cascadia Alliance, it is more difficult to detect the failure mode.",
    "char_start": 4289,
    "char_end": 4393,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 171.61,
    "end": 174.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone ignores.",
    "char_start": 4394,
    "char_end": 4463,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 174.0,
    "end": 176.57,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What heuristic do you always come back to?",
    "char_start": 4481,
    "char_end": 4523,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 176.57,
    "end": 180.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
    "char_start": 4524,
    "char_end": 4580,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 180.0,
    "end": 181.95,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "In short: cuts in the banking (or berm) on slopes are not optional.",
    "char_start": 4601,
    "char_end": 4668,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 181.95,
    "end": 184.14,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "The shortcut taken in the first year leads to a collapse in the third year.",
    "char_start": 4669,
    "char_end": 4744,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 184.14,
    "end": 186.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I have seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4745,
    "char_end": 4809,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 186.0,
    "end": 187.74,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the failure mode?",
    "char_start": 4827,
    "char_end": 4852,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 187.74,
    "end": 192.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
    "char_start": 4853,
    "char_end": 4914,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.0,
    "end": 193.29,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 4935,
    "char_end": 4987,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 193.29,
    "end": 194.88,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "The structure of the soil is more important than people realize.",
    "char_start": 4988,
    "char_end": 5052,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 194.88,
    "end": 196.26,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 5053,
    "char_end": 5109,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 196.26,
    "end": 198.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I've already seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 5110,
    "char_end": 5180,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 198.0,
    "end": 200.75,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "char_start": 5198,
    "char_end": 5231,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 200.75,
    "end": 204.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "How does Shimano fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 5232,
    "char_end": 5271,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 204.0,
    "end": 207.39,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Yes, look – I've changed my mind about machine-made trails compared to hand-made ones.",
    "char_start": 5292,
    "char_end": 5378,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 207.39,
    "end": 210.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5379,
    "char_end": 5445,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 210.0,
    "end": 216.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Where does it stop working?",
    "char_start": 5463,
    "char_end": 5490,
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 216.0,
    "end": 219.27,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Outside of the RockShox-level tools, it's more difficult to detect the failure.",
    "char_start": 5511,
    "char_end": 5590,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 219.27,
    "end": 222.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5591,
    "char_end": 5657,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 222.0,
    "end": 228.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final section to the management of territory.",
    "char_start": 5675,
    "char_end": 5770,
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 228.0,
    "end": 234.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "That's where the conversation gets interesting, because the issues surrounding land management permeate everything we've discussed.",
    "char_start": 5791,
    "char_end": 5922,
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 234.0,
    "end": 235.89,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "char_start": 5940,
    "char_end": 5973,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 235.89,
    "end": 240.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the opposing viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
    "char_start": 5974,
    "char_end": 6046,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.0,
    "end": 242.24,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "In essence, drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 6067,
    "char_end": 6152,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 242.24,
    "end": 243.66,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox products.",
    "char_start": 6153,
    "char_end": 6207,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 243.66,
    "end": 246.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 6208,
    "char_end": 6297,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 246.0,
    "end": 247.74,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the failure mode?",
    "char_start": 6315,
    "char_end": 6340,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 247.74,
    "end": 252.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
    "char_start": 6341,
    "char_end": 6402,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 252.0,
    "end": 255.28,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too steep a slope.",
    "char_start": 6423,
    "char_end": 6517,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 255.28,
    "end": 258.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "The context is important because it tells you what commitments you are making.",
    "char_start": 6518,
    "char_end": 6596,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 258.0,
    "end": 264.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Before we finish, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
    "char_start": 6614,
    "char_end": 6681,
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 264.0,
    "end": 268.13,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and apply it for two weeks.",
    "char_start": 6702,
    "char_end": 6766,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 268.13,
    "end": 270.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Everything else is iteration.",
    "char_start": 6767,
    "char_end": 6796,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 270.0,
    "end": 272.19,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "And to finish, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "char_start": 6814,
    "char_end": 6871,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.19,
    "end": 274.96,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Linear is the issue tracker designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
    "char_start": 6872,
    "char_end": 6944,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 274.96,
    "end": 276.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Check it out at linear.com.",
    "char_start": 6945,
    "char_end": 6972,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 276.0,
    "end": 282.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Rafael Vasconcelos, thank you for the conversation.",
    "char_start": 6973,
    "char_end": 7024,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.0,
    "end": 288.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Thank you, Beatriz.",
    "char_start": 7045,
    "char_end": 7064,
    "unit_id": "t0045.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0045.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 288.0,
    "end": 292.17,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "That's all for today on \"Trail Sessions.\"",
    "char_start": 7082,
    "char_end": 7123,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 292.17,
    "end": 294.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "See you next time.",
    "char_start": 7124,
    "char_end": 7142,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s02"
  }
]
